# agrune/maps CODEOWNERS
#
# Default review is NOT required for manifest contributions — the PR bot
# (.github/workflows/pr-bot.yml) handles schema validation + sensitive-diff
# labeling + velocity hold-down automatically. The rules below gate only the
# governance-critical files that decide policy (incident list, maintainer
# allow-list, governance doc, workflow/script code, root README).
#
# Placeholder `@agrune-solo` MUST be replaced with the real GitHub handle
# (or @agrune/maintainers team) after the external push. See
# `.planning/phases/18-registry/external-sync-instructions.md` § 1.

/incidents.json                @agrune-solo
/REGISTRY_GOVERNANCE.md        @agrune-solo
/maintainers.json              @agrune-solo
/CODEOWNERS                    @agrune-solo
/.github/workflows/            @agrune-solo
/.github/scripts/              @agrune-solo
/README.md                     @agrune-solo

# Manifest contributions (manifests/**) intentionally have no global owner —
# community tier PRs are merge-able by PR bot label rules + branch protection.
